Shiver is a plant grown for smoking. Its leaves are processed into a hallucinogen that gives a quick high and wears off fast, and it is often mixed with tobacco and taken in hookah bars. Selling it is legal in much of [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]], but growing it is not: a grower has to buy the right to sow the seed from the company that owns it.

That licence, more than the drug itself, is why a grow like the one behind the warehouse at 414 Anchor Street in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]] was kept out of sight. [[People/Sbrtlby Jotes|Sbrtlby Jotes]] ran his works as a front for shiver, in a hydroponics bay behind the warehouse, and was not paying the fee.
